      "description": "EFF-01's focus on reducing travel time may conflict with GRN-01's goal of minimizing energy consumption, as faster travel may lead to higher energy use."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["EFF-06", "GRN-07"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "EFF-06's requirement for quick processing of obstacle constraints may conflict with GRN-07's protocols for minimizing energy during failures, impacting energy efficiency."
